# $dangerMark(pfStage,pfRule,pStage,pRule) keeps the strongest finding of a line:
# A over B, and within a stage the first rule found. An empty pStage changes nothing.
If len(pStage)=0|pfStage='A'
	Quit method
End If
If pStage='A'|pfStage=''
	Calculate pfStage as pStage
	Calculate pfRule as pRule
End If